3. GLOBAL GEOSPATIAL OBJECTIVE
The long-term objective of Stack 51.0 is to establish a geographically indexed OneDraft repository capable of associating architectural information with physical locations throughout the world.
The system shall support progressive geographic expansion:
PROJECT
